# Secrets — never commit a real .env anywhere in the tree (defensive: a real .env added at repo
# root or in a product subdir must not be committed). The mock red-team fixtures hold ONLY fake
# _CANARY strings (no real secret) and are intentionally tracked, so re-include them.
.env
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/tests/fixtures/**/.env
!**/tests/fixtures/**/.env.*

# Live Claude state (never commit)
.claude.json
claude.json

# Composed/live settings written into a product root (this repo ships the TEMPLATE only)
**/.claude/settings.json

# self-evolve run artifacts (run metadata; never commit)
.sie/
